        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Geri Halliwell, Geraldine Estelle \"Geri\" Horner\n- Organizations: Spice Girls\n- Roles: pop girl group, pop singer-songwriter, clothes designer, author, actress\n\nFacts:\n- The Spice Girls were an English pop girl group formed in the summer of 1994.\n- Geri Halliwell was an original member of the Spice Girls and was known as \"Ginger Spice.\"\n- Geraldine Estelle \"Geri\" Horner was born on 6 August 1972.\n- Geraldine Estelle \"Geri\" Horner is an English pop singer-songwriter, clothes designer, author, and actress.",
