        "original_id": "2a1e5dd3-5834-5b06-a4d0-eddaa002d48c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Spice Girls\n- People: Melanie Brown, Melanie Chisholm, Emma Bunton, Geri Halliwell, Victoria Beckham\n- Roles: Scary Spice, Sporty Spice, Baby Spice, Ginger Spice, Posh Spice\n\nFacts:\n- Geri Halliwell was born as Geraldine Estelle Halliwell on 6 August 1972.\n- Geri Halliwell is also known as Geri Horner.\n- Geri Halliwell is an English pop singer-songwriter, clothes designer, author, and actress.\n- The Spice Girls originally consisted of Melanie Brown, Melanie Chisholm, Emma Bunton, Geri Halliwell, and Victoria Beckham.\n- Melanie Brown was known in the Spice Girls as Scary Spice.\n- Melanie Chisholm was known in the Spice Girls as Sporty Spice.\n- Emma Bunton was known in the Spice Girls as Baby Spice.\n- Geri Halliwell was known in the Spice Girls as Ginger Spice.\n- Victoria Beckham, née Adams, was known in the Spice Girls as Posh Spice.",
